+* `LLAMA_R46_CKPT_FAIL_ALLOC=N` — the Nth buffer-type allocation/placement attempt of one
+  finalization fails.
+* `LLAMA_R46_CKPT_FAIL_COPY=N` — the Nth tensor copy of one finalization fails.
